{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can experience robot action that makes the most of the individuality of each of the 15 units. Each unit has its own unique movements, such as transformable types that can be used as fighters, tanks, helicopters, etc., close-combat types that can wield two weapons or have both a shotgun and a laser sword, four-legged types with hovering capabilities, and hover types with unique movements and high mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- TPS robot action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Includes a two-time respawn system and a wingman system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The unit used is fixed for each map, and you will respawn in a different unit each time your unit is destroyed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 15 units to use and 12 maps to play on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- You can also request artillery support and supplies from the mother ship.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550410?t=1740802860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550410?t=1740802860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550410/39aed094d09b800d9dde4838c6020a1e67e7d5a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740802860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550410/39aed094d09b800d9dde4838c6020a1e67e7d5a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740802860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can experience robot action that makes the most of the individuality of each of the 15 units. Each unit has its own unique movements, such as transformable types that can be used as fighters, tanks, helicopters, etc., close-combat types that can wield two weapons or have both a shotgun and a laser sword, four-legged types with hovering capabilities, and hover types with unique movements and high mobility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- TPS robot action game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Includes a two-time respawn system and a wingman system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- The unit used is fixed for each map, and you will respawn in a different unit each time your unit is destroyed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 15 units to use and 12 maps to play on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- You can also request artillery support and supplies from the mother ship.</p>","developers":["\u30ed\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u8ecd\u56e3"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550410/header.jpg?t=1740802860","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107778,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107778/movie480.mp4?t=1740802857","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107778/movie_max.mp4?t=1740802857"},"name":"SteelArk_PV1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107778/e436a76d68189c01e3e629fefec37b1b4b51a388/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740802857","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107778/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740802857","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107778/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740802857"}}],"name":"SteelArk","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"